    <name>Full Steam Ahead</name>
    <summary>A desktop app to import games from other launchers into Steam.</summary>
    <description>
        <p>
            Full Steam Ahead scans your other game launchers, including, Heroic, Lutris, Bottles,
            Legendary, MiniGalaxy, itch.io, and Flatpak apps and adds them to your Steam
            library as non-Steam shortcuts. It matches grid images, hero art, and logos from
            Steam and SteamGridDB, organizes imports into collections, and lets you review
            every change before anything is applied. A backup is created automatically so you
            can always roll back.
        </p>
    </description>
